//@version=6
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// OSC-VIP v7.4 INSTITUTIONAL — Single-Slot Model-Score & Microstructure Engine
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Merges Overlay Structural Price Action (SMC CHoCH, Liquidity, FVG)
// with Sub-pane Microstructure Math & Oscillator Visuals (VWAP Z, SMPI Pressure, Cornish-Fisher Z,
// Kaufman ER, Shock Guard, SNR, N_eff, Signal Ledger, Model-Score HUD).
//
// Features a manually weighted evidence model that produces a heuristic score
// from 0-100%, arbitrating conflicting signals into:
//  - Tier 1: A+ Harmonized Execution (Bright Label + ATR SL/TP, Model Score >= 65%)
//  - Tier 2: Structural Only (Configurable Shapes/Labels, Model Score 50-65%)
//  - Tier 3: Trap Risk / Friction Warning (Dimmed Gray "⚠️ TRAP", Model Score < 50%)
//
// New in v7.4:
//  - Dedicated Structure Long / Short toggles, styling, and alert conditions.
//  - LuxAlgo-style Volume Delta Candles rendered on Solid Conviction bars with normal candle fallback.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
indicator("OSC-VIP v7.4 Institutional", shorttitle="OSC-VIP-v7.4", overlay=false, 
     max_lines_count=500, max_boxes_count=500, max_labels_count=500, max_bars_back=2000, precision=4)

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 1. MASTER CONTROLS & BAYESIAN ENGINE INPUTS
